@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@merchantA = demo-merchant-a
@merchantProductId = 101
@customerId = 1
@orderId = 1

### 准备商家商品：应用启动后执行 scripts/merchant-demo.sql

### 创建客户：通用 CRUD
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/customer/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "options": {"requestId": "commerce-customer-create-1"},
  "payload": {
    "displayName": "Ada Lovelace",
    "email": "ada@example.com"
  }
}

### 下单：演示主体经显式 place 场景授权；提交商家商品 ID，服务端确定 merchantId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/action/place
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payload": {
    "customerId": {{customerId}},
    "items": [
      {"merchantProductId": {{merchantProductId}}, "quantity": 2}
    ]
  }
}

### 查询订单及明细：orderId 取下单响应 data.orderIds 中的一项
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"options": {"filter": {"id": {{orderId}}}, "expandRelations": ["customer", "orderItemList"]}}

### 默认订单创建未授权
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/create
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload": {"customerId": {{customerId}}}}
